+              "support": "Equation (4), p. 3, identifies the simple-group one-loop gauge-coupling shift. The separate argument on pp. 7–8 shows that the U(1) Fayet–Iliopoulos correction is a one-loop matter tadpole proportional to the sum of chiral charges."
+            },
+            {
+              "name": "Explicit opposite-charge U(1) FI cancellation example",
+              "disposition": "included",
+              "item": "ex-qftx-n1-u1-fi-charge-trace",
