+---
+id: pthm-qftx-n1-wilsonian-f-term-nonrenormalization
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: N=1 Wilsonian F-Term Nonrenormalization
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
