+---
+id: ex-qftx-n1-u1-fi-charge-trace
+kind: example
+title: U(1) Fayet–Iliopoulos Cancellation by Charge Trace
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 5
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
