+---
+id: def-qftx-wilsonian-n1-action-data
+kind: definition
+title: Local N=1 Wilsonian Superspace Action Data
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 3
+domain: physics
+library: physics
+category: advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry
